<title>CZECH REPUBLIC: Czech utility 96 net profit 281.1 mln.</title>
<headline>Czech utility 96 net profit 281.1 mln.</headline>
<dateline>PRAGUE 1997-03-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary unaudited results for year ending December 31, 1996: (in millions of crowns)</p>
<p> Gros Profit    344.811     vs     524.617</p>
<p> Net Profit     281.086     vs     307.309</p>
<p> Revenues	6,060.913     vs   4,958.984</p>
<p> Total Assets  5,729.487     vs   4,136.198</p>
<p>Note. Full company name is Zapadoceska Energetika a.s., a regional electricity distributor in western Bohemia.</p>
<p>-- Prague Newsroom, 420-2-2423-0003</p>
</text>
